\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj 1.  \cf0  Bless the Lord, O my soul aright, 
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   Who with love and mercy crowns you;
\par   My heart and mouth his love proclaim.                                 
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   And all within me praise His name!                                        
\par   He who forgives me all my sins,
\par   And heals my illnesses:\tab 
\par   
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  He saves me from death's bondage,                                               
\par  And brings me close to Him.                                                       
\par   He satisfyeth my soul;                                                  
\par   He can to me my strength renewed          
\par   On wings of eagle me to fly,\tab   
\par   To Him, all my praise I give.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  The Lord shows us his righteousness\tab   
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   and takes the side of the oppressed;\tab    
\par   And even in the wilderness\tab   
\par   He proved his power to the distressed.\tab  
\par   He does not always punish us;
\par   His anger is slow and controlled:
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\qj   
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6    Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\qj    He keeps us with his kindness,                                        
\par    His patience is untold.
\par    His grace is high as heaven
\par    For all those who honour His name;
\par   Our sins, He has so forgiven
\par    and drives out away our shame.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. God's love and goodness never end
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\qj   For those who fear His holy name,
\par   Who always follow His command
\par   And walk before Him without blame
\par   His throne stands firm in highest heaven;
\par   He rules as a King over all:
\par   
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\qj   The strong and mighty angels
\par   Will listen to his call.
\par   The heavenly powers praise Him,
\par    His servants bow down to His grace;
\par    I never cease to worship Him
\par \pard      With others in every place.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

